t one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiao Ming really likes to eat chocolate, but he recently starts a healthy diet plan. There is a famous chocolate shop near Xiao Ming's school, he particularly likes the chocolate there. The chocolate shop releases a new product recently, he has too much homework, plans to find a day to try it. His friend asks him if he wants to go buy chocolate together after school, Xiao Ming replies: \"I have something to do after school, so I don't go with you?\"\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Xiao Ming say he doesn't want to go buy chocolate with his friend?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Because he wants to stay healthy.\nB. Because he doesn't want his friend to know he breaks his healthy diet plan.\nC. Because he doesn't have money to buy chocolate.\nD. Because his schoolwork is too heavy.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e3f9d6006945d2806a59","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368505364,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:41:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"9f32ae42044a4991bc7b8de417e2ca30"}